# Spark IDE keymap — proven keys, quit (`q`) focus.
# After ide new chain (9ed6112). Quit already in asm — this slice
# documents+tests the `q` token like save (`s`) / run (`r`).
# Dry: script `q` → {"cmd":"quit"} + ends loop; open still reads.
# Also proves single `ide key quit` after open.
# Run: ./spark --dry-run examples/ide_keys_quit.spark
# No Electron. No new asm — documents proven keys only.

ide keys "examples/fixtures/ide/cmds_quit.txt"

ide key open "examples/hello.spark"

ide key quit
